    "en": "DeepSeek AI's original LLM. Released November 29, 2023. Adopts LLaMA architecture, trained on 2 trillion tokens (English + Chinese). Available in 7B and 67B sizes. 67B uses Grouped-Query Attention (GQA) for efficiency."
